WEBVTT

00:12:29.597 --> 00:12:30.944
And once again:

00:12:30.968 --> 00:12:33.526
privatized gains, socialized losses.

00:12:33.550 --> 00:12:35.615
Is anybody else sick of this pattern?

00:12:35.639 --> 00:12:40.262
(Applause)

00:12:40.286 --> 00:12:46.245
So we need a more inclusive way
to safeguard our prosperity,

00:12:46.269 --> 00:12:47.426
our privacy

00:12:47.450 --> 00:12:49.216
and soon, our lives.

00:12:49.240 --> 00:12:51.978
So how do we do all of this?

00:12:52.002 --> 00:12:54.670
Well, when bodies fight pathogens,

00:12:54.694 --> 00:12:57.092
they use ingenious immune systems,

00:12:57.116 --> 00:12:59.161
which are very complex and multilayered.

00:12:59.185 --> 00:13:02.123
Why don't we build one of these
for the whole damn ecosystem?